; bal -V --unrealized values each posting at its cost only when the running
; total is the sum of the journal's postings and the report displays that
; total.  The reports below do not meet that condition, so they keep the
; revaluation between postings and print what they printed before the
; balance report valued postings at cost.
;
; --plopen makes the amount a pair of amount and cost, valued at today; a
; baseline of plain amounts cannot be added to that pair ("Cannot add
; sequences of different lengths").  -A displays a running average, which
; divides the total by the number of postings, and seeds the running total
; of the automated Expenses:Taxes and Assets:Checking postings from a
; per-account accumulator; a baseline summed over every posting printed
; Equity:Unrealized Losses as $10.06 instead of $5.00.  --deviation
; displays each amount less the total, which is no running total either; a
; baseline printed Equity as -120 instead of -60.  Budget reports receive
; budget postings whose amount is negated but whose cost is not; a
; baseline read from those costs booked the budgeted purchases as a
; $1160.00 loss, and the budget command, which pairs each amount with its
; budget, failed ("Cannot compare an amount to a sequence").  Under
; --forecast the posting that ends the forecast enters the running total
; but is filtered out after the revaluation, so a revaluation at the
; terminus would include a gain that no displayed row carries.  Under -V
; or -X, --immediate values each posting on its own date already, and a
; baseline at cost booked the $40.00 gain realized by the sale a second
; time, as Equity:Unrealized Losses $40.00.  An amount expression given
; with -t is not one the report builds itself, and a baseline would read the
; cost in place of the amount, which is the cost of the posting's
; contribution only for an expression that passes the amount on as it is.
; market(amount, value_date, exchange) is the expression that --immediate
; installs, and a baseline at cost booked the $40.00 gain again; an
; expression that tests the commodity of the amount read the commodity of
; the cost, and a baseline at cost booked the whole $1020.00 value of the
; AAPL held as Equity:Unrealized Gains.  -H nails each posting at its
; value on its own date and books no revaluation at the report date, so
; its report has no unrealized row; on this journal a baseline at cost
; prints the same, and regress/1692 shows where it does not.  -G reports
; the gain itself, market value less cost; a baseline at cost booked its
; unrealized row as $-120.00 instead of $-60.00.  --inject
; adds a posting for the Fee tag of the purchase, and the posting it
; generates keeps the $1500 cost of the posting it copies; a baseline read
; from that cost printed Equity:Unrealized Losses $1375.00.  The last
; report, with none of these options, values postings at cost and foots.

= Books
    Expenses:Taxes                0.05
    Assets:Checking              -0.05

~ Monthly
    Assets:Brokerage              1 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/01 Buy
    ; Fee: $5
    Assets:Brokerage             10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/15 Books
    Expenses:Books               $10.00
    Assets:Checking

2024/02/01 Sell
    Assets:Brokerage             -4 AAPL {$150} @ $160
    Assets:Checking              $640
    Income:Capital Gains

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $170

test bal -V --unrealized --plopen --now 2024/04/01
             $120.00  Assets:Brokerage
end test

test bal --exchange $ --unrealized --plopen --now 2024/04/01
             $120.00  Assets:Brokerage
end test

test bal -V --unrealized -A --now 2024/04/01
              $24.92  Assets
             $510.00    Brokerage
            $-217.62    Checking
               $5.00  Equity:Unrealized Losses
               $5.25  Expenses
              $10.00    Books
               $0.50    Taxes
             $-40.00  Income:Capital Gains
--------------------
              $12.50
end test

test bal --exchange $ --unrealized -A --now 2024/04/01
              $24.92  Assets
             $510.00    Brokerage
            $-217.62    Checking
               $5.00  Equity:Unrealized Losses
               $5.25  Expenses
              $10.00    Books
               $0.50    Taxes
             $-40.00  Income:Capital Gains
--------------------
              $12.50
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --deviation --now 2024/04/01
            $-149.50  Assets
                 -60  Equity
                 -10  Expenses
                  40  Income
--------------------
            $-180.00
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --budget --now 2024/04/01
              $69.50  Assets
             $340.00    Brokerage
            $-270.50    Checking
--------------------
              $69.50
end test

